| Time | Content |
|---|---|
| 0:00–0:45 | **Problem.** Agent payments are live in India. ACP excludes fraud by design. Legacy models don't just degrade — they invert, because an agent looks like a bot to every signal they use. |
| 0:45–1:30 | **The gap nobody's covering.** Show A6: valid agent, valid credential, valid mandate, in-limit amount — and the purchase was dictated by a poisoned webpage. Every existing control passes it. |
