## 9. Verify Before You Build

Do these in your first two days — they can change your plan:

1. Create a Razorpay test account and confirm which mandate endpoints you can actually exercise. TPAP Pro may have access requirements; if mandates are restricted, **Subscriptions** is your fallback primitive for delegated authority — the abstraction still holds.
